as temperatures drop.", "evidence_ko": "Nordstrom 정기 재입고 상품으로 수년째 라인업 유지, 매 시즌 재입고 즉시 품절 반복", "evidence_en": "Maintained as a regularly restocked line item at Nordstrom for several consecutive years, selling out immediately on each seasonal restock", "product_url": "https://www.nordstrom.com/s/gucci-velvet-trim-belted-wool-coat/5304625", "source": "Nordstrom", "source_url": "https://www.nordstrom.com/s/gucci-velvet-trim-belted-wool-coat/5304625", "published_at": "2026-10-12"}, {"category": "rtw", "label": "new", "name": "Cropped Single-Breasted Silk Blazer (Peak Lapel)", "line": "Generation Gucci Tailoring", "price": "$2,974 (sale) / $4,226 (original)", "image_url": "https://cdna.lystit.com/300/375/tr/photos/luosophy/7241a5ea/1125x1500/gucci-Black-Cropped-Single-Breasted-Silk-Blazer-With-Peak-Lapels.jpeg", "image_local": "rtw-03-blazer.jpg", "image_note": "제품 단독 - 블랙 실크 크롭 블레이저, 피크라펠", "image_note_en": "Product only - black silk cropped blazer with peak lapels", "why_ko": "뎀나의 F/W26 런웨이 분석에서 '테일러드 팬츠·블레이저'가 룩의 핵심 비중을 차지한다는 보도와 맞물려 출시된 신상 크롭 블레이저다. 몸에 밀착된 실루엣과 짧은 길이가 '90년대 톰 포드 시대 섹시 테일러링' 복각 서사에 정확히 들어맞아, 기존 수트 구매층보다 젊은 세그먼트로의 확장 여지가 크다.", "why_en": "This new cropped blazer launched alongside runway analysis showing tailored pants and blazers as dominant look categories in Demna's FW26 collection, and its body-hugging, shortened silhouette fits precisely into the '90s Tom Ford-era sexy tailoring revival narrative, giving it room to expand into a younger segment beyond the existing suiting customer base.", "evidence_ko": "Numero·WWD 런웨이 리뷰가 테일러드 팬츠·블레이저를 FW26 컬렉션 핵심 트렌드로 보도; Lyst 등 리테일러가 신상으로 입고", "evidence_en": "Numero and WWD runway reviews flagged tailored pants and blazers as the core trend of the FW26 collection; listed as a new arrival on retailers including Lyst", "product_url": "https://www.lyst.com/clothing/gucci-double-breasted-cropped-blazer-1/", "source": "WWD", "source_url": "https://wwd.com/runway/fall-2026/milan/gucci/review/", "published_at": "2026-10